          },
          {
            "type": "scroll-view",
            "name": "ScrollView",
            "id": "scrollView",
            "width": "100%",
            "height": 172,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "container",
                "name": "ContentNode",
                "id": "contentNode",
                "width": "100%",
                "height": 164,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "label",
                    "name": "LogLabel",
                    "id": "logLabel",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "height": 164,
                    "styleSlot": "log.label.content",
                    "bind": "battleLog.message"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "widget": {
          "right": 288,
          "top": 836
        }
      }
    ],
    "height": 72,
    "_comment": "PROG-2-10133 (B1): 5 個功能鈕搬到頂欄右側橫排（圖示＋2 字說明，外觀由 BattleButtonStyle 統一繪製）；退出鈕在 HUD 頂欄最右（72 寬），與功能群隔 24px。戰報本體展開時開在右下指令座左側。SidePanelRoot 右緣 = 頂欄 padding 32 + 退出 72；觸控範圍 76×72，1280×720 等效 51×48。"
  }
